$model_ah_merge_lora — merge LoRA adapter and export GGUF

SUMMARY
  Merges LoRA from files[] into Qwen2.5-Coder HF base, converts to quantized GGUF.

SYNTAX
  @gguf: @lora -> $model_ah_merge_lora(model='1.5b', quant='Q4_K_M')

INPUT
  files[] — LoRA .zip from $model_ah_train_lora (or adapter_config.json link)

OUTPUT
  files[] — .gguf model file

ARGUMENTS
  model= — 1.5b (default)
  quant= — llama.cpp quant type (default Q4_K_M)
  output_name= — gguf basename (default model)

ENV
  AH_LLAMA_CPP — optional path to existing llama.cpp clone
  AH_LLAMA_CPP_AUTO_DOWNLOAD=1 — download convert tools to .cache/llama.cpp (default on)
  AH_LLAMA_CPP_CACHE — override download cache directory
  Without llama-quantize built, quant=Q4_K_M falls back to q8_0 GGUF
  AH_EMULATE_MODEL_AH_MERGE_LORA=1 — stub .gguf for tests

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No.
